{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2023-02-22 16:30:00', 'title': 'DANAHER ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'WASHINGTON , FEB. 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.27 PER SHARE OF ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON APRIL 28, 2023 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON MARCH 31, 2023. IN ADDITION, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $12.50 PER SHARE OF ITS 5.00% SERIES B MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK, PAYABLE ON APRIL 17, 2023 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON MARCH 31, 2023.'}